                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Data coverage is used to assess </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Workday (WD) headcount information gaps</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>.</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>For each brand, we compare the submitted entities against those available in WD to identify mismatches. The list of employees missing in WD can be viewed and downloaded for further review.</run>
