                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Data quality is a gauge of consistency between WD data and the information submitted by the brands through CSRD disclosure. It flags discrepancies and supports teams in making the necessary corrections in either data source. This is available only for brands with HC on WD.</run>
